{"id": "22-3785-2-2", "zh": "不定过去时（ajjattanī）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3786-2-5", "zh": "下面讲不定过去时。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-3787-2-31", "zh": "587. 表示过去时，用 ī、uṃ、o、ttha、iṃ、mhā、ā、ū、se、vhaṃ、aṃ、mhe 这些语尾（Bhūte ī uṃ o ttha iṃ mhā ā ū se vhaṃ aṃ mhe）［ka.419；rū.469；nī.887］。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-3788-2-14", "zh": "“已经有过”（abhavī）就叫作 bhūta，意思是过去。表示过去的时间时，在动词词根之后接 ī 等语尾。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3789-2-44", "zh": "588. 在 a 系、ī 系、ssā 系、ssati 系语尾中，以辅音起首的语尾前面加 i（A ī ssā ssatyādīnaṃ byañjanassiu）［ka.516；rū.466；nī.1030；caṃ.1.2.76；pā.3.2.110；多本作 aīssaādīnaṃ byañjanassiu］。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-3790-2-11", "zh": "在 a 系、ī 系、ssā 系、ssati 系语尾中以辅音起首的语尾开头，加上 i。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3790-12-26", "zh": "用“辅音”（byañjanassa）这个词，排除了由单纯元音构成的十二个语尾：a 系中的五个，ī 系中的七个。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-3791-2-11", "zh": "依据“Āīssādīsvau vā”这条规则，词根前面可以任选地加上 a。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3792-2-61", "zh": "他：abhavī、bhavī；他们：abhavuṃ、bhavuṃ；你：abhavo、bhavo；你们：abhavittha、bhavittha；我：abhaviṃ、bhaviṃ；我们：abhavimhā、bhavimhā；他：abhavā、bhavā；他们：abhavū、bhavū；你：abhavise、bhavise；你们：abhavivhaṃ、bhavivhaṃ；我：abhavaṃ、bhavaṃ；我们：abhavimhe、bhavimhe。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-3793-2-32", "zh": "依据“Āīū”等规则，ī、mhā、ā、ū 变为短音时，就成为：他：abhavi、bhavi；我们：abhavimha、bhavimha；他：abhava、bhava；他们：abhavu、bhavu。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-3794-2-34", "zh": "589. eyyātha、sse、a、ā、ī、tha 依次可以换成 o、a、aṃ、ttha、ttho、vho（Eyyāthasseaāīthānaṃ o a aṃ ttha ttho vho vā）［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105；多本作“… vhoka”］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3795-2-7", "zh": "eyyātha 等语尾依次可以换成 o 等。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-3796-2-49", "zh": "你们：gaccheyyātho 或 gaccheyyātha；你：agacchissa 或 agacchisse；我：agamaṃ、gamaṃ 或 agama、gama；他：agamittha、gamittha 或 agamā、gamā；他：agamittho、gamittho 或 agamī、gamī；你们：gacchavho 或 gacchatha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3797-2-29", "zh": "依据这条规则，ī、ā、a 三个语尾分别换成 ttho、ttha、aṃ：他：abhavittho、bhavittho；他：abhavittha、bhavittha；我：abhavaṃ、bhavaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3798-2-31", "zh": "这里有以下圣典用例。ī 换成 ttho 的情形：paṅko ca mā visiyittho［jā.1.13.44］，sañjagghittho mayā saha［jā.1.16.241］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3798-32-78", "zh": "ā 换成 ttha 的情形：anumodittha vāsavo［jā.2.22.1667］，nimantayittha vāsavo［jā.2.22.1667］，khubbhittha nagaraṃ tadā［jā.2.22.1673］，subhūtitthero gāthaṃ abhāsittha［theragā.1］。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-3798-79-120", "zh": "a 换成 aṃ 的情形：idhāhaṃ mallikaṃ deviṃ etadavocaṃ［saṃ.ni.1.119］，ajānamevaṃ āvuso avacaṃ jānāmīti［pārā.195］，ahaṃ kāmānaṃ vasamanvagaṃ［jā.2.19.45］，ajjhagaṃ amataṃ santiṃ 等。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-3799-2-21", "zh": "590. uṃ 换成 iṃsu、aṃsu（Uṃssiṃsvaṃsu）［ka.504、517；rū.470-488；nī.1016-1105］。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-3800-2-7", "zh": "uṃ 这个语尾换成 iṃsu 或 aṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3801-2-7", "zh": "例如 agamiṃsu、agamaṃsu、agamuṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3801-8-15", "zh": "依据这条规则，uṃ 换成 iṃsu：abhaviṃsu、bhaviṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3802-2-23", "zh": "591. o 换成 a、i、ttha、ttho（Ossa a i ttha ttho）［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105］。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-3803-2-5", "zh": "o 换成 a 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3804-2-13", "zh": "你：abhava；你：abhavi；你：abhavittha；你：abhavittho。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-3805-2-36", "zh": "这里有以下圣典用例。o 换成 a 的情形：mā hevaṃ ānanda avaca［dī.ni.2.95］，tvameva dāni ’makara, yaṃ kāmo byagamā tayi［jā.1.2.167］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3805-37-68", "zh": "换成 i 的情形：mā tvaṃ bhāyi mahārāja, mā tvaṃ bhāyi rathesabha［jā.2.22.684］，mā cintesi mā tvaṃ soci, yācāmi luddakaṃ ahaṃ［出处待考］。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "22-3805-69-108", "zh": "换成 ttha 的情形：māssu tiṇṇo amaññittha［jā.2.22.255］，mā kilittha mayā vinā［jā.2.22.1713］，māssu kujjhittha nāvika［jā.1.6.5］。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-3805-109-174", "zh": "换成 ttho 的情形：mā purāṇe amaññittho［theragā.280］，mā dayhittho punappunaṃ［saṃ.ni.1.212］，tiṇamatte asajjittho［jā.1.1.89］，mā tvaṃ brahmuno vacanaṃ upātivattittho［ma.ni.1.502］，mā tvaṃ maññittho na maṃ jānātī［ma.ni.1.502］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3806-2-11", "zh": "其中，mā dayhittho 等形式也可以用远过去时（parokkhā）的语尾构成。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-3807-2-28", "zh": "依据拆分规则（suttavibhatta），ttha 换成 ttho：taṃ vo vadāmi bhaddante, yāvantettha samāgatā［apa.thera 1.1.367］，massu mittānaṃ dubbhittho。", "confidence": 62}
{"id": "22-3807-29-41", "zh": "Mittadubbho hi pāpako［jā.1.16.222］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3808-2-65", "zh": "依据大规则（mahāvutti），o 有时被省略：puna dānaṃ adā tuvaṃ［jā.2.22.1786］，mā no tvaṃ tāta adadā［jā.2.22.2126］，mā bhoti kupitā ahu［jā.2.22.1931］，māhu pacchānutāpinī［saṃ.ni.1.162；therīgā.57］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3809-2-19", "zh": "592. o 换成 si（Si）［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3810-2-6", "zh": "o 可以换成 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3811-2-9", "zh": "你：abhavasi、bhavasi；你：anubhosi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3812-2-19", "zh": "593. 在 mhā、ttha 的开头加 u（Mhātthānamuu）［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105］。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "22-3813-2-8", "zh": "在 mhā、ttha 的开头加上 u。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3814-2-11", "zh": "可以见到 assosumhā、ahesumhā、avocumhā、avocuttha 等形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3815-2-21", "zh": "你们：abhavuttha、bhavuttha 或 abhavittha、bhavittha；我们：abhavumhā、bhavumhā 或 abhavimhā、bhavimhā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3816-2-31", "zh": "594. 在 iṃ 等的开头也加 su（Iṃssa ca suu）［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105；多本作“… siu”］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3817-2-13", "zh": "在 iṃ 以及 mhā、ttha 的开头加上 su，意思是增加 s 插音（sāgama）。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-3817-14-30", "zh": "由于有“ca”（也）这个字，在 ī 等语尾的开头也增加 s 插音；增加了 s 插音，语尾就以辅音起首，于是它的开头又可以加上 i 插音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3817-31-71", "zh": "因此，“imā gāthā abhāsisuṃ［出处待考］，te me asse ayācisuṃ, yathābhūtaṃ vipassisuṃ”［jā.2.22.1863］等形式［dī.ni.3.277］得以成立。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "22-3818-2-20", "zh": "他享受了财富：anubhosi 或 anubhavi；你们：anubhosittha 或 anubhavittha；我：anubhosi 或 anubhaviṃ。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-3818-21-25", "zh": "我们：anubhosimhā 或 anubhavimhā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3819-2-29", "zh": "595. 在以 e、o 结尾的词之后，uṃ 换成 suṃ（Eontā suṃ）［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105；多本作“eottā suṃ”］。", "confidence": 74}
{"id": "22-3820-2-10", "zh": "在以 e 结尾和以 o 结尾的词之后，uṃ 这个语尾可以换成 suṃ。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-3821-2-15", "zh": "例如 ānesuṃ、sāyesuṃ、cintesuṃ、paccanubhosuṃ、paribhosuṃ、adhibhosuṃ、abhibhosuṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3822-2-24", "zh": "依据拆分规则，在以 ā 结尾的词之后也可以这样：vihāsuṃ viharanti ca［saṃ.ni.1.173］，te anubhosuṃ。以上这些是单纯主动态的形式。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3823-2-7", "zh": "财富被他享受了：anvabhūyī、anubhūyī。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "22-3824-2-5", "zh": "变为短音时：anvabhūyi、anubhūyi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3825-2-5", "zh": "辅音重叠时：anvabhuyyi、anubhuyyi。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "22-3826-2-13", "zh": "财富被他享受了：anvabhūyuṃ、anubhūyuṃ、anvabhūyiṃsu、anubhūyiṃsu 等，这些是单纯被动态的形式。", "confidence": 74}
{"id": "22-3827-2-21", "zh": "他修习了道：abhāvi、bhāvi、abhāvesi、bhāvesi、abhāvayi、bhāvayi；他们修习了道：abhāviṃsu、bhāviṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
